#. Status labels
msgid "ON"
msgstr "ACTIVÉ"

msgid "OFF"
msgstr "DÉSACTIVÉ"

msgid "on"
msgstr "activé"

msgid "off"
msgstr "désactivé"

msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(aucun)"

msgid "flag file"
msgstr "fichier de flags"

msgid "launcher"
msgstr "lanceur"

msgid "cannot tell"
msgstr "indéterminé"

msgid "not patched yet"
msgstr "pas encore appliqué"

#. Status block
msgid "Autoscroll"
msgstr "Autoscroll"

msgid "Applications covered"
msgstr "Applications couvertes"

msgid "%d of %d"
msgstr "%d sur %d"

msgid "Not identified"
msgstr "Non identifiées"

msgid "%d (see the applications list)"
msgstr "%d (voir la liste des applications)"

msgid "Steam"
msgstr "Steam"

msgid "Middle-click paste"
msgstr "Collage au clic du milieu"

msgid "New applications"
msgstr "Nouvelles applications"

msgid "Last applied"
msgstr "Dernier passage"

msgid "Applications pick this up the next time they are started."
msgstr "Les applications le prennent en compte à leur prochain démarrage."

#. Menu
msgid "Turn autoscroll on or off"
msgstr "Activer ou désactiver l'autoscroll"

msgid "Re-apply everything"
msgstr "Tout réappliquer"

msgid "Applications"
msgstr "Applications"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Quitter"

msgid "Press any key to continue..."
msgstr "Appuyez sur une touche pour continuer..."

msgid "One moment..."
msgstr "Un instant..."

#. Settings
msgid "Turn off middle-click paste"
msgstr "Désactiver le collage au clic du milieu"

msgid ""
"Stops middle click from pasting anywhere else. Starts with the next login."
msgstr "Le clic du milieu ne colle plus ailleurs. Dès la prochaine connexion."

msgid "Cover new applications"
msgstr "Couvrir les nouvelles applications"

msgid "Applications installed later get autoscroll on their own."
msgstr ""
"Les applications installées plus tard reçoivent l'autoscroll d'elles-mêmes."

msgid "More Chromium arguments"
msgstr "Autres arguments Chromium"

msgid "Passed to every application along with the autoscroll one."
msgstr "Transmis à chaque application avec celui de l'autoscroll."

msgid "Up/Down: select, Space: change, q: back"
msgstr "Haut/Bas : choisir, Espace : changer, q : retour"

msgid "Arguments separated by spaces, empty for none:"
msgstr "Arguments séparés par des espaces, vide pour aucun :"

msgid "Could not save the setting."
msgstr "Impossible d'enregistrer le paramètre."

#. Applications screen
msgid "Looking at the installed applications..."
msgstr "Examen des applications installées..."

msgid "No Chromium-based applications found."
msgstr "Aucune application basée sur Chromium trouvée."

msgid "Anything marked \"cannot tell\" stays off until it is turned on here."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui est marqué « indéterminé » reste désactivé jusqu'à être activé ici."

msgid "Autoscroll is off. This is what would be covered."
msgstr "L'autoscroll est désactivé. Voici ce qui serait couvert."

msgid "Up/Down: select, Space: turn on or off, q: back"
msgstr "Haut/Bas : choisir, Espace : activer ou désactiver, q : retour"

msgid "Search:"
msgstr "Rechercher :"

msgid "Type to search, Down: go to the list, Esc: back"
msgstr "Tapez pour rechercher, Bas : aller à la liste, Échap : retour"

msgid "No matches."
msgstr "Aucun résultat."

#. Results
msgid "Autoscroll is on for %d applications."
msgstr "L'autoscroll est activé pour %d applications."

msgid ""
"Applications that are already running pick this up when they are restarted."
msgstr ""
"Les applications déjà ouvertes le prennent en compte après un redémarrage."

msgid "Could not start the watcher for newly installed applications."
msgstr "Impossible de démarrer la surveillance des nouvelles applications."

msgid ""
"No systemd user session, so newly installed applications will not be picked "
"up on their own."
msgstr ""
"Pas de session utilisateur systemd, les nouvelles applications ne seront "
"donc pas prises en charge d'elles-mêmes."

msgid "Autoscroll is off and everything that was changed has been put back."
msgstr ""
"L'autoscroll est désactivé et tout ce qui avait été modifié a été rétabli."

msgid "Autoscroll is off. Turn it on first."
msgstr "L'autoscroll est désactivé. Activez-le d'abord."

msgid "Applied again to %d applications."
msgstr "Réappliqué à %d applications."

msgid "Applied to %d applications."
msgstr "Appliqué à %d applications."

msgid "Already applied to %d applications."
msgstr "Déjà appliqué à %d applications."

msgid ""
"Steam starts its interface in a way this version cannot change without Steam "
"noticing; leaving it alone."
msgstr ""
"Steam lance son interface d'une façon que cette version ne peut pas modifier "
"sans que Steam le remarque ; Steam reste tel quel."

msgid ""
"Steam's interface cannot be given the flag without leaving a file Steam "
"would reinstall; the change has been taken back."
msgstr ""
"L'interface de Steam ne peut pas recevoir le flag sans laisser un fichier "
"que Steam réinstallerait ; la modification a été annulée."

msgid "Middle click stops pasting at the next login."
msgstr "Le clic du milieu ne collera plus à la prochaine connexion."

#. Help
msgid "Usage: middleclick-autoscroll [command]"
msgstr "Utilisation : middleclick-autoscroll [commande]"

msgid "Commands:"
msgstr "Commandes :"

msgid "Turn autoscroll on"
msgstr "Activer l'autoscroll"

msgid "Turn it off and put everything back"
msgstr "Le désactiver et tout rétablir"

msgid "Apply to anything installed since the last run"
msgstr "Appliquer à tout ce qui a été installé depuis le dernier passage"

msgid "Take everything back and apply it again"
msgstr "Tout annuler et réappliquer"

msgid "Show what is covered"
msgstr "Afficher ce qui est couvert"

msgid "List every application that was found"
msgstr "Lister toutes les applications trouvées"

msgid "Show this help"
msgstr "Afficher cette aide"

msgid "Show the version"
msgstr "Afficher la version"

msgid "Without a command an interactive menu is shown."
msgstr "Sans commande, un menu interactif s'affiche."

msgid "Unknown command: %s"
msgstr "Commande inconnue : %s"

#. Time
msgid "never"
msgstr "jamais"

msgid "just now"
msgstr "à l'instant"

msgid "1 minute ago"
msgstr "il y a 1 minute"

msgid "%d minutes ago"
msgstr "il y a %d minutes"

msgid "1 hour ago"
msgstr "il y a 1 heure"

msgid "%d hours ago"
msgstr "il y a %d heures"

msgid "1 day ago"
msgstr "il y a 1 jour"

msgid "%d days ago"
msgstr "il y a %d jours"
